1
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:07,871
Damn, I got 56.
I almost failed.

2
00:00:07,871 --> 00:00:10,153
How much did you get, Bud?

3
00:00:10,153 --> 00:00:15,650
Probably about the same as you… wait,
wasn't yours 49?

4
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:21,192
Huh? What? What the hell are you talking about?

5
00:00:21,192 --> 00:00:25,954
Wanna compare? If you're so confident,
come compare with me then.

6
00:00:25,954 --> 00:00:29,524
Oh wow. You really said that.

7
00:00:29,524 --> 00:00:33,723
You idiots, stop being nasty.
Mine's 49.

8
00:00:33,723 --> 00:00:35,920
Super tiny.

9
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:39,449
You dumbass—
I mean my exam score! I failed.

10
00:00:39,449 --> 00:00:44,531
Then you gotta take the retest, right? Book?

11
00:00:44,531 --> 00:00:48,915
Yeah. Just take it with the teacher on Friday.

12
00:00:48,915 --> 00:00:53,279
It's not hard. They use the same test.
Just memorize the answers.

13
00:00:53,279 --> 00:00:56,286
Alright bro. Then can you tutor me?

14
00:00:56,286 --> 00:00:58,036
Tomorrow evening, I should be free.

15
00:00:58,036 --> 00:01:02,178
Thanks, man. Oh—
how much did you get again?

16
00:01:03,231 --> 00:01:04,537
A perfect 100.

17
00:01:04,537 --> 00:01:07,303
Holy shit, that's insane.

18
00:01:07,303 --> 00:01:10,566
No way. Book, what do you think?

19
00:01:10,566 --> 00:01:12,513
Frame brought a girl into school again.

20
00:01:12,513 --> 00:01:14,028
Huh? Again?

21
00:01:16,196 --> 00:01:19,065
Go drag him up here.
Class starts in 10 minutes.

22
00:01:19,065 --> 00:01:22,466
He never listens to us.
You have to go get him.

23
00:01:22,466 --> 00:01:25,431
If not, he'll be cuddling a pillar in the bathroom
the whole period again.

24
00:01:25,431 --> 00:01:27,688
Last time he skipped class and got punished.

25
00:01:27,688 --> 00:01:31,015
We had to clean the entire damn school bathroom.
It was hell.

26
00:01:32,236 --> 00:01:33,343
I'm not doing that again.

27
00:01:33,816 --> 00:01:38,016
Fine, I'll handle it.
Where is he?
